1
00:00:00,099 --> 00:00:02,097
Kjenner du noen med en IBC-tank i

2
00:00:02,097 --> 00:00:02,859
hagen?

3
00:00:02,859 --> 00:00:04,619
Gi dem denne gaven.

4
00:00:04,619 --> 00:00:07,063
Mannen min elsker hagen sin, og

5
00:00:07,063 --> 00:00:09,586
han har klaget på det samme i to

6
00:00:09,586 --> 00:00:10,439
somre.

7
00:00:10,439 --> 00:00:12,819
Alger i regnvannstanken.

8
00:00:12,819 --> 00:00:14,879
Jeg ville gi ham noe han faktisk

9
00:00:14,879 --> 00:00:16,874
ville bruke, ikke bare en dings

10
00:00:16,874 --> 00:00:18,779
som ender opp i et skap.

11
00:00:18,779 --> 00:00:21,493
Så jeg bestilte et IBC-tanktrekk

12
00:00:21,493 --> 00:00:23,459
fra Beverbutikken.

13
00:00:23,459 --> 00:00:25,699
Han ble helt overrasket.

14
00:00:25,699 --> 00:00:27,369
En stund trodde han at jeg hadde

15
00:00:27,369 --> 00:00:29,092
glemt problemet han hadde snakket

16
00:00:29,092 --> 00:00:30,459
om hele sommeren.

17
00:00:30,459 --> 00:00:32,676
Nå er tanken beskyttet, vannet er

18
00:00:32,676 --> 00:00:34,827
klart, og han viser den frem til

19
00:00:34,827 --> 00:00:36,180
alle naboene.

20
00:00:36,180 --> 00:00:38,220
Noen ganger er den beste gaven den

21
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,259
som løser et problem noen allerede

22
00:00:40,259 --> 00:00:41,700
har hatt lenge.

23
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,316
Gi bort et IBC-tanktrekk fra

24
00:00:44,316 --> 00:00:45,624
Beverbutikken.

25
00:00:45,624 --> 00:00:49,120
Enkel gave, stor takknemlighet.
